---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Services - Bruce Bybee Photography">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif mb-12 text-center">Photography Services</h1>
    <ul class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Live Events & Performances:</span> <i>Starting at $200/hour.</i> Concerts, theater, readings and public programs. Coverage includes key moments, audience interaction, and environmental context.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Exhibitions & Installations:</span> <i>Starting at $200/hour.</i> Installation views, artwork documentation, and spatial context for galleries and museums.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Portraiture:</span> <i>Starting at $150/hour.</i> Artist portraits, editorial sessions, and professional headshots, on location, or in studio.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Touring Artists:</span> <i>Starting at $200/hour.</i> Press-ready photography and performance documentation for visiting productions.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Translation/Interpretation:</span> <i>Starting at ...</i> </li>
    </ul>
    <div class="text-center mt-12">
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-block px-8 py-3 text-sm tracking-wide bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors">
        Book Now
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 py-24 border-t border-gray-100">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif mb-8 text-center">Delivery and Booking</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
      <li>Approximately 15 edited images per hour of coverage.</li>
      <li>Standard delivery within 3 days via private online gallery.</li>
      <li>50% deposit required to confirm booking.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 py-24 border-t border-gray-100">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif mb-8 text-center">Additional Options</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Expedited Delivery:</span> Select images delivered within 12-24 hours for press and promotional use.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Institutional Partnerships:</span> Ongoing event and exhibition coverage for organizations seeking consistent documentation throughout a season or program year.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Usage & Licensing:</span> Standard coverage includes non-exclusive promotional and editorial use. Commercial campaigns, extended usage, or exclusive rights can be licensed separately. Photographer retains copyright unless otherwise agreed in writing.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Cancellation Policy:</span> Cancellations within 48 hours of the scheduled booking may be subject to a fee.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 py-24 border-t border-gray-100">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif mb-8 text-center">Translation and Interpretation </h2>
    <ul class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Scope:</span> Available for contemporary literature, cultural writing, and institutional materials. Services are available for publishers, artists, and cultural organizations, including exhibition texts, press materials, and public programs.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Past References:</span> Samples and references available upon request.</li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Usage & Licensing: All my writing belongs to me.</span> </li>
      <li><span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Cancellation Policy:</span> </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
